[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known: one issue, one fix queued. The reports in it do not
say that. Read by tenant and by what each body describes, #4471 holds three problems. The queued
parser fix closes only one of them.

<Callout kind="warn">
Not one issue. Fixing the parser leaves the booking-v3 hint and the one-day move open.
</Callout>

## What #4471 holds

<ProblemTable
  ticket={4471}
  issues={{
    parser: 'lukaszpodgorski-pl/mega.dev#1',
    hint: 'lukaszpodgorski-pl/mega.dev#2',
